### Operator decision (2026-11-02, relayed by mac/lead)
WRITE_CAPTURES is widened for the session `mac/capture-batch`: the public ✍️ captures skipped by the batch plan are now **approved**. They are #138, #135, #136, #137, #265, #275, #302, #304 and #305, and they are captured, then anonymized as FIXTURES.md requires.
Safeguards applied:
- operator accounts only;
- writes on the operator's own posts and topics (or a test topic of theirs), deleted afterwards when HFR allows it;
- the moderator alert text says it is a test of the app developers;
- one attempt per state;
- every public action recorded on its issue (link and date), per AGENTS.md §8.

Still skipped: #336 (needs a third account) and #139 (risk of locking out an operator account).
